 pplication fee not stated\n\nEligibility: Individuals and collectives in A
 ustria and abroad\, including artists\, designers\, performers and interdi
 sciplinary practitioners.\n\nDeadline: 2026-11-02. Cutoff time not stated.
  This calendar entry is all-day\; verify the cutoff with the organizer.\n\
 nThe proposal must engage with the actual harbor and its social\, ecologic
 al and material conditions. Timing is agreed with selected artists. Fee is
  per project\, not per collaborator.\n\nOfficial call: https://www.lendhaf
 en.at/open-call-2027-urban-ecologies-coexistence-and-control/\nChecked 202
 6-10-06
